%% Source baseline: 3c156b5, matching the reports.
%% Photon transports RPCs; it does not perform the board rule validation shown here.
%% The 3D arena path is represented, not the separate Tank implementation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant owner as Active client
    participant board as Master control flow
    participant clients as All clients
    participant arena as Master 3D arena

    owner->>clients: RPC roll request with player ID and dice
    clients->>clients: Check active turn and input locks
    clients->>board: Master branch of the roll handler
    board->>board: Resolve routes and tile rules
    board->>clients: RPC with full board state as JSON
    clients->>clients: Apply world effects, positions and HUD

    alt Board round has ended
        board->>clients: Round completion event
        board->>clients: Start game with seed and player IDs
        clients->>clients: Lock board input and start game
        owner->>clients: Broadcast locally detected elimination
        arena->>arena: Finalize received elimination order
        arena->>clients: RPC with final ranking
        clients->>clients: Show results and emit completion
        board->>board: Award rewards and check round limit
        alt More rounds remain
            board->>clients: RPC with new round and turn order
        else Final round completed
            board->>clients: RPC with winner in board state
            clients->>clients: Show winner and reset to lobby
        end
    end
